ary on top, resizable xterm.js terminal below), with an engine toggle (Claudeâ†”Gemini, Gemini research-only), per-lane doc roles, and a project cost/tokens/time rollup.\n\n- **Self-maintaining.** A daily 5 AM healthcheck (`anchor_healthcheck.py`, Task Scheduler) parses every file, boots a throwaway server, exercises every endpoint and the fully-stubbed v2/v3/v4 R&D surfaces, and writes a dated report â€” surfacing a red dashboard banner on failure.\n\n- **Branding.** Presented as a **Ghost World Labs** tool \"Powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢,\" using the one vendored brand mark as favicon and masthead lockup.\n\nThese claims are grounded in the project's `CLAUDE.md` and the locked North-Star/decision anchors; I didn't re-verify them against the live code this turn. Want me to spot-check any specific claim against the source?","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9e2f7e30-2ac4-4396-99ed-34ceff33268e","total_cost_usd":0.080647,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45363,"output_tokens":1163,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1163,"cache_read_input_tokens":45363,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1248,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001318,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8[1m]":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1163,"cacheReadInputTokens":45363,"cacheCreationInputTokens":4410,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.079329,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode